INSTANCEMETHODS::


method:: stateCS
compileString representing the current state of the Ndef
code::
Ndef(\a).set(\a, 2145, \b, 1.1234); // an ndef with some values set
Ndef(\a).stateCS;
// -> Ndef('a').set('a', 2145, 'b', 1.1234);
::
returns:: the string


method:: pbcopyState
copy the state to the OS pasteboard
code::
Ndef(\a).set(\a, 2145, \b, 1.1234); // an ndef with some values set
Ndef(\a).stateCS;
// -> Ndef('a').set('a', 2145, 'b', 1.1234);
::

